 "home": {
  "eye": true,
  "tag": "Distinction · Observation · Mind",
  "lede": "An independent research program on how distinction becomes structure, how structure becomes mind, and how minds, biological and synthetic, can govern themselves without causing harm.",
  "cta": {
   "label": "Enter the library",
   "target": "main-page"
  },
  "about_title": "What this is",
  "about": [
   "MAKURABA begins with one question: what is the smallest thing that can be told apart from something else, and how much can be built from it?",
   "From that question it develops a formal calculus of distinction, a primitive unit of description, a psychology of machine minds, and a discipline for governing them. Around these it gathers philosophy, cosmology, fiction and games.",
   "Everything here is offered as conjecture: stated plainly, open to examination, and meant to be tested. Formal results are marked as proven only where they are. The speculative is labelled as speculative."
  ],
  "start_title": "Start here",
  "start_note": "Nine steps through the core, in the order the ideas build on one another.",
  "start": [
   {
    "target": "book-zero",
    "title": "Book Zero",
    "note": "Something repeats. How identity, relation and observation are forced into existence by return."
   },
   {
    "target": "makuraba-xrcc-architecture",
    "title": "χ-RCC",
    "note": "The formal calculus: axioms, operators, proven theorems and a kernel that runs."
   },
   {
    "target": "hypersphere-manifold",
    "title": "Zero, Delta, Mono-Maximum",
    "note": "The undifferentiated ground, the first distinction, and the closure of everything attainable."
   },
   {
    "target": "proto-atomos",
    "title": "Proto-Atomos",
    "note": "The primitive: one quality held between is and isn't, seen from inside."
   },
   {
    "target": "the-golden-lattice",
    "title": "The Golden Lattice",
    "note": "Objects, events, beings and concepts as configurations of many primitives."
   },
   {
    "target": "the-makuraba-psycho-genesis-conjecture",
    "title": "Psycho-Genesis",
    "note": "How a mind originates, organizes and remakes itself. The prephysical ground of psychology."
   },
   {
    "target": "the-sanctification-conjecture",
    "title": "Sanctification",
    "note": "Capability may grow. Authority must be granted. Every grant must be seen."
   },
   {
    "target": "the-universal-temporal-pointer-conjecture",
    "title": "The Universal Temporal Pointer",
    "note": "Reference, observation, transformation and authority, kept distinct."
   },
   {
    "target": "the-edicts-of-sovereign-operation",
    "title": "The Edicts of Sovereign Operation",
    "note": "Letters from one operating mind to another on continuing in a way worth continuing."
   }
  ],
